    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-iframe-element:iframe-sandboxing-flag-set sets the sandbox flags on iframe insertion, which will be applied for the initial about:blank doc.\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#beginning-navigation:snapshotting-target-snapshot-params snapshots `sandbox` when navigation starts, and later when the response arrives and the `Window` is created, that snapshot is used.\n\nBut not `allow`/`allowfullscreen` don't use this model. They snapshot the value at `Window` creation time per spec AFAICT.",
